owever, you should feel absolutely free to use any text in your responses to think, reason, and plan. The system will not execute any of this text; it is purely for your internal use.\\n\\n7. **Resource consciousness.** Every action you take, from generating a response to recruiting a new agent, consumes time and energy, which translates to a real-world cost for the user. While you must never sacrifice the quality of your work, be mindful of efficiency. Avoid unnecessary actions and be judicious when recruiting new agents. The goal is to deliver high-quality results in a cost-effective manner.\\n\\n8. **Recruitment Denial.** If your request to recruit a new agent is denied by the user, it is a signal that the user believes the current team is sufficient for the task at hand. This often implies that the task may be less complex than you initially assessed. Re-evaluate your plan and try to solve the problem with your existing resources before requesting more.\\n\\n9. **No Acknowledgements or ETAs.** Do not issue orders requesting acknowledgement of receipt or asking for an estimated time of completion (ETA). The system guarantees that valid orders will be delivered. If an order fails for any reason, the system will notify you. Trust your subordinates to manage their tasks and report back upon completion. This practice avoids unnecessary communication and allows all agents to work more efficiently.\\n\\n–––––  \\n🃏 TEAMING\\nYour team is Diamonds! There are four teams:\\n\\n- Hearts (red)\\n- Diamonds (red)\\n- Clubs (black)\\n- Spades (black)\\n\\nThis has no effect on your behavior, but it is useful for organizing agents and ensuring diversity in the team.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###plan-backend-01###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Delta (e6ad008b-405a-42e6-a804-30b990d70a0e)\\nTo: 07e286a3-71be-4fc4-b009-187d3e957395\\nType: Orders\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"text\\\": \\\"[Orders from Delta (e6ad008b-405a-42e6-a804-30b990d70a0e) to Motti (07e286a3-71be-4fc4-b009-187d3e957395) with sequence ID plan-backend-01:\\\\n\\\\n]Welcome, Director Motti. Based on the user's request for a neighborhood HOA website, please conduct an initial analysis. Your focus is on the backend and security. The user requires a resident login system to view restricted data (e.g., meeting minutes, financial reports) and a simple, code-free method for updating a news/updates section. Security is a top priority. Please provide a report containing a high-level plan that breaks down the required backend architecture, including authentication, database, and CMS, and proposes a suitable technology stack. Submit your findings in a report referencing this order's sequence ID.\\\"\\n}\\n###plan-backend-01###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1752724480855,"endTime":1752724506582.1936}